window.products.push({"id":81038,"name":"Sealegend Dryer Vent Cleaner Kit 7 Pack Dryer Cleaning Tool Set 35 Feet Dryer Vent Brush Dryer Lint Vacuum Hose Attachment Dryer Interior Brush Dryer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pqRRoCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[35 Feet Dryer Vent Brush] - Easy to use with your drill, the 25 flexible nylon rods can be quickly connected and extended to 35ft.The included drill attachment accessory allows you to attach the dryer vent brush to the drill, making your cleaning effortless and easier. [Dryer Vent Vacuum Hose Attachment] - Don't want to pay a premium to hire a cleaning company to disassemble and clean your clothes dryer? The Sealegend dryer vent vacuum hose attachment can help you clean the lint trap in hard-to-reach places. It fits most vacuum cleaners, except for handheld or compact models. The vacuum cleaner comes with a brush to help clear the lint trap before you vacuum up the lint. [Wool Dryer Balls&Washer Balls] - Dryer balls made of premium wool help to soften clothes, save time, and conserve energy. Wool dryer balls and washer balls can also reduce wrinkling in clothes and sheets, and prevent clothes from rubbing against each other. [Clothes Dryer/Washer Front Door Prop] - The Sealegend front load dryer washer door prop can help you cool down quickly after using your dryer and stay cool after using your washing machine.The magnet and hose are covered with rubber, so they will not rust and can last for years. They will also not scratch the surface of your washing machine. NOTE: The item is suitable for metal front load washers, but it will not work on stainless steel or plastic washers because they are not magnetic. [Preventing Fire Hazard] - Lint buildup can be dangerous and failure to clean it is the leading cause of clothes dryer fires. So remove the lint periodically is the only way to prevent dryer fires risk. [Efficient dryer cleaning tool set]-Professional cleaning tool set can help you deep clean buildup lint in the dryer. Including 35 feet Dryer Vent Brush*1, Dryer Lint Vacuum Attachment*1, Lint Trap Brush*1, Wool Dryer Ball*4, Silicone Ball*4, Front Load Washer/Dryer Door Prop*1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pqRRoCnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sealegend","source_asin":"B0BS98NCX3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS98NCX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS98NCX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
