window.products.push({"id":81082,"name":"Dezitrek LARGE All in One Hand Wash Bag and Plunger Set - Off Grid Washing Machine Non Electric for Camping Travel | Eco Friendly Portable Manual Clot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alwH5BwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dezitrek plunger wash bag gives you the freedom to wash your clothes on the go in just minutes. This all in one wash bag and plunger set is the smallest portable manual clothes washer that can handle the largest load and will pay for itself in just a few washes, SAVING YOU TIME AND MONEY spent at laundromats . With it's compact off the grid design, Dezitrek makes the only hand wash laundry bag you will ever need. Just like a front loader washing machine, our flexible plunger head moves up and down agitating and plunging the dirty clothes, driving soapy water through the fabric, loosening and forcing the dirt out, leaving you with CONFIDENTLY CLEAN CLOTHES. Featuring a telescopic collapsible plunger shaft with a T-Bar handle designed for comfort and portability, together with the flexible bag this complete mobile laundry system compacts into a neat set, small enough to fit into your suitcase making for the perfect portable clothes washer to take with you everywhere . Built to last with the highest quality materials and components subjected to rigid quality assurance. Whether you are a backpacker on a road trip, camping in a tent, traveling in an RV or camper van, staying in hotels or hostels, living in an apartment or just at home making eco-conscious choices for your laundry, this product is for you. No more laundromats or scrub washing your underwear in the hotel bathroom. You can even use it as a laundry hamper between washes. We are proud to say this product can save water compared to conventional washing machines, and is an eco friendly way to wash your clothes, with a low environmental impact requiring no electricity or batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alwH5BwsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEZITREK","source_asin":"B0BSRXXY9V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSRXXY9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSRXXY9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
