window.products.push({"id":81120,"name":"Awoco RH-R06-36 Rectangle Vent 6\" High Stainless Steel Under Cabinet 4 Speeds 900CFM Range Hood with LED Lights (36\"W Rectangle Vent)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":350.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZPR4vy8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SLIM 6” HIGH, 1mm THICK - under cabinet or wall mounted, high quality 1 mm thick stainless steel with brush finishing. Please don’t suspect that a range hood without protective films is not a new product. The protective films on the body were removed to complete the brush finished polishment on the surface. Perfectly fit under the 12” deep standard cabinet; provide slick style and powerful performance. DUCTED VENT OUTDOOR, RECTANGLE TOP / REAR VENT - 3-1/4” x 10” interchangeable rectangle adapter and cover for top or rear exhaust vent. Air damper is included. CAUTION: please check your existing venting duct before purchasing, there are rectangle or round ducts at different sizes. 4 SPEEDS POWERFUL OPERATION WITH DIMMABLE BRIGHTNESS LED LIGHTS - 4 speeds (Quiet, I, II, III up to 900 CFM), blue-lighted soft touch electronic buttons with 2 of 3W energy saving cold dimmable brightness LED lights. 2 motors rotate oppositely. Power rating: 120V/60Hz, 110W Min /150W Max. Power cord with plug is included. Noise level at low: 49 dB, 4.5 sones. Noise level at high: 62 dB, 11.0 sones. 3 DISHWASHER SAFE BAFFLE FILTERS, 3 MINUTES AUTO SHUT OFF - Dishwasher safe commercial style stainless steel baffle air filters. The oil is contained in the baffle filters, no oil holders needed. 3 minutes timer delayed auto shut off to vent the leftover smoke after done cooking. 3 YEARS USA LIMITED PARTS WARRANTY - ETL Certified. Free parts, repair or exchange (if not repairable) within 3 years. Awoco high quality product reputation and supreme customer service is a guarantee. Dimensions: 35-3/4\"W x 19-3/4\"D x 6\"H, 6\" High low profile, for 36\" kitchen ranges. Hood weight: 35 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZPR4vy8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Awoco","source_asin":"B0958RLTSY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0958RLTSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0958RLTSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
