window.products.push({"id":81380,"name":"SMETA Propane Freezer Refrigerator 12v Chest Gas Outdoor Camper Freezer Cooler LPG AC/DC 3-way Absorption System for Garage Off Grid Solar 2.4 Cu.Ft B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sySuMaGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12v Propane Refrigerator/Freezer chest 2.4 cu.ft with Lock：3-Ways power selection:110v/12v/LPG. Dimensions(wdh): 26.1*20.3*27.0 inch; Temperature range: 8~53.6℉(-13~12 ℃); Net weight：81.6lbs；Approximate gas consumption per day: 0.7 lb. Small Chest Freezer for Camping: Our 12 volt freezer with handle & removable basket & thermostat control is designed for off-grid living: Eco-friendly, no noise, no vibration, no Freon, no pollution, low energy consumption: This rugged, light-weight 12v freezer features side handles for easy portability, and it can also run on propane, propane is well known as a clean /cheap energy, just feel free and enjoy the fresh food for camping/ travel/road trip, etc. Mini Deep Gas Freezer Garage Ready: It has a space-saving design with compact sizes,the auto-hold door hinges between 45° and 90° angles allow you to easily access the chest freezer hands-free. The upper removable storage basket is convenient for storing small items and food to be taken out soon and sliding easily, you can quickly see the items below. Adjustable feet balance the chest freezer on an uneven surface, it offers much convenience for storage. Portable Cooler Quick Freeze: The adjustable thermostat is easy to access and features a minimum/maximum control dial that allows your temperature to be controlled from 8 °F to - 53 °F. Thermoelectric cooler comes with a 12V DC adapter for use in your car, truck, or boat; also compatible with AC power for indoors; You can cool drinks or chill meat with the outdoor freezer, It's perfect for outdoor activities. Home/Off-grid Dual &1-year warranty: We provide a 12-month warranty and any problems with this propane freezer only, please feel free to contact us at anytime. Freezer Combo free: basket, lock, LPG regulator (12v power bank and gas canister not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sySuMaGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMETA","source_asin":"B071R215F9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071R215F9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B071R215F9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
