window.products.push({"id":81710,"name":"20 Pack WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet Kit by Beaquicy - Replacement for G-E Hot-point Ken-more Range - Replaces 247410, AP2622260, EAP241358,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+0ZlVqBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rubber ✅【20 PACK】-- WB2K101 Rubber Gate Feet is for ranges, can keep your grate level so that your pan can also be level and provide even cooking. Avoid the potential for cookware tipping over due to unstable grate placement. Each support shelf foot of the grate needs to be installed so that your grate remains balanced. Worn or missing burner feet can cause scratches on your gas hob and spoil the look of your hob.The package includes 20 x Rubber Grate Feet. There is a 1mm vent hole in the center of the footpad. The shaft diameter is 4.5 mm/0.18 inch. The shaft length is 5.5 mm/0.22 inches, suitable for 3/16\" holes. Zoom in slightly to ensure a better fit. ✅【RUBBER MATERIAL】-- The WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet is made from high-quality, durable, heat-resistant rubber material. The high quality material makes the WB2K101 Rubber Feet better able to withstand high temperatures and less likely to melt and emit a pungent smell due to high temperatures. The Range Grate Rubber Feet have been manufactured with a slightly enlarged shaft to allow for a better fit into the grate and to prevent easy dislodgement, and require a little force to insert the rubber feet into the grate. ►A pack of 20 rubber feet will satisfy your need for multiple replacements and is also less expensive than buying multiple smaller packs. ✅【60 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The 20 Pack WB2K101 Rubber Gate Feet support 60 DAYS return and exchange. ►The worn out burner feet pads will not only scratch the surface of your hob and spoil the aesthetics of your cooktop. It can also leave your grate without proper leveling, causing pots to tilt and cook unevenly, resulting in unsafe cooking. Our range grate rubber feet can protect your range, tabilize your pans, keep your grates and pans level even for cooking. If your rubber grille feet are worn or missing, it could cause the pan to tilt, you need to replace it. The pack of 20 is enough to fit one of each foot on each grate. ✅【SUITABLE FOR MANY MODELS】-- WB2K101 Burner Grate Rubber Feet replacement for G-E, Ken-more, Hot-point Range. Replace: 247410, AP2622260, EAP241358, PS241358. ►20 Pack WB2K101 Rubber Feet compatible: EGR3001EH3SS, P2B918DEM4BB, JGBP32WEJ1WW, JGBP35WEA5WW, JGBP33DEM1WW, JGB650DEF2BB, JGB650DEF1BB, JGB650SEF3SS, PGB910SEM1SS, PGB910SEM2SS, PGB910SEM3SS, PGB910SEM4SS, JGB750EEF1ES, JGB750EEF2ES, JGB750EEF3ES, JGB920SEC3SS, JGB285DET2BB, PGB908SEM2SS, JGBP85BEB5BB, JGBP86DEM1BB, JGBP87SEM3SS, JGBP88SEL3SS, JGBP89SEM2SS, JGBS23DEM1SS, PGB918SEM2SS, PGB918SEM3SS, PGB918SEM4SS, 36275701002, 36275702001, 36275707001, 36275708001, RGB845BEC3WH, RGB845WEC1WW, RGB845WEC2WW, RGB845WEC3WW, etc. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of WB2K101 Range Burner Grate Rubber Feet is very simple and does not require any tools, just work gloves to protect your hands. Turn the grate over, pop out the old feet and put the new parts in place. It is recommended to apply High Temp Silicone or Adhesive to the Rubber Pads. This simple operation can solve the problem that the grate is not properly leveled and the pan is not evenly tilted. NOTE: When installing, wait until the surface of the cooktop and grate has cooled down to avoid burns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+0ZlVqBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082XQY27M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XQY27M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XQY27M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
