window.products.push({"id":81837,"name":"Countertop Crunchy Nugget Ice Maker, 26lb Chewable Nugget Ice/Day, Self-Cleaning, Auto Water Refill, Ice Maker with 3.3lb Ice Bin and Scoop for Party,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yAYMj-zaL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥤【Get More Ice In Shorter Time】: Compared to standard tough ice cubes, nugget ice is soft to chew and match well with drinks. The countertop ice maker can produce nugget ice in just 18 mins, generating 26lbs per day and the bin can hold 3.3lb at a time. 🍿【A Chewable Joy】: The crunchy nugget ice suits well with soft drinks. The pebbly-looking ice maintains the flavor of the beverage so you have a tasty treat to chew. For those who love icy beverage, crushed ice may be a perfect companion with your go-to cocktail. 🍦【Smart Ice Refill】: Whenever you need the ice, the portable ice maker is always have it ready. Once the ice bin is full, it will stop making ice and continue after the ice is scooped out. When the ice melts, the water will return to the reservoir, where it will simply be made back into ice. 🧉【Make Cleaning a Breeze】: By pressing the “CLEAN” button for 3s to start a 5min cleaning cycle to flush clean water through the system. The ice bin need cleaning manually with diluted detergent. Measures a compact 16.7*9.5*16.7 inches size, the ice maker suits perfectly on most counters at home or even at office. 🍹【Auto Water Refill】: When you connect the machine to the water supply, the water will be refilled automatically once the reservoir is empty. The whole process is hassle-free. (If you do not want to connect it to the plumbing, you can add water manually). 📣 : We values your satisfaction. We provide 12 months warranty, lifetime technical support, and 24-hour professional customer service. If you have any questions with our ice maker, Please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yAYMj-zaL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leuwd","source_asin":"B09LHFCC3V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-81837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LHFCC3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LHFCC3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
